VALUES (NULL, NULL, 313, 'SWAT 3: Close Quarters Battle', 'SWAT 3: Close Quarters Battle', 'game', 1999, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co8yzj.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/cenhvzdua4gezxm8dezn.jpg', 'SWAT 3: Close Quarters Battle (also known as SWAT3 or SWAT3:CQB) is a tactical squad-based first-person shooter, developed by Sierra Northwest and published by Sierra Entertainment for Windows-based PCs. It is the seventh installment of the long-running Police Quest and SWAT series.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/swat-3-close-quarters-battle', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 8.1, 0, 8.01, '2026-11-20 01:06:03', '2026-11-20 01:06:03')
