VALUES (NULL, NULL, 1294, 'Tom Clancy''s Ghost Recon', 'Tom Clancy''s Ghost Recon', 'game', 2001, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1ygn.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar8hw.jpg', 'The Red Army is back. Now that Russia''s government has collapsed, a hardline leader is bent on taking over the republics. Enter Ghost Recon, an advanced, futuristic squad of U.S. Army soldiers. Unlike previous Rainbow Six games, the setting is much more focused on the military instead of anti-terrorist maneuvers. Next-generation inventory and weapons will give players a glimpse into the real U.S. Army "Land Warrior" program on which Ghost Recon is based.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/tom-clancy-s-ghost-recon', '["Xbox", "Nintendo GameCube", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac", "PlayStation 2"]', NULL, 7.1, 0, 7.54, '2026-11-20 01:06:03', '2026-11-20 01:06:03')
