VALUES (NULL, NULL, 305160, 'Gears of War: E-Day', 'Gears of War: E-Day', 'game', 2026, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coc77n.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6hoa.jpg', 'Experience the brutal horror of Emergence Day through the eyes of Marcus Fenix in the origin story of one of gaming''s most acclaimed sagas.​ Fourteen years before Gears of War, war heroes Marcus Fenix and Dom Santiago return home to face a new nightmare: the Locust Horde. These subterranean monsters, grotesque and relentless, erupt from below, laying siege on humanity itself. ​Built from the ground up with Unreal Engine 5, Gears of War: E-Day delivers unprecedented graphical fidelity.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/gears-of-war-e-day', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PC (Microsoft Windows)"]', NULL, 7.9, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-20 01:06:03', '2026-11-20 01:06:03')
